### Topic 45 - calling external APIs (VS Code "REST Client": click "Send Request")
### Works with both profiles: default (real JSONPlaceholder) and "offline" (built-in mock).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- 1. RestTemplate ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-template/posts/1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-template/posts?userId=2

### ---------- 2. RestClient ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-client/posts/2

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-client/posts?userId=1

### Create (JSONPlaceholder fakes it and returns id 101)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-client/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "title": "Learning RestClient",
  "body": "It reads like a sentence!"
}

### Two calls combined (sequential)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-client/users/1/summary

### Remote 404 -> our 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rest-client/posts/999

### ---------- 3. WebClient ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/web-client/posts/3

### Two calls combined (parallel, Mono.zip)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/web-client/users/2/summary

### ---------- 4. HTTP interface (@HttpExchange) ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/http-interface/posts/4

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/http-interface/posts?userId=3

### ---------- Error handling ----------

### Remote answers after 10 s, our read timeout is 5 s -> 503
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/errors/timeout

### Remote answers 500 -> our 502 Bad Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/errors/remote-500

### ---------- The mock itself ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/mock-api/posts/1
